_type: Concept
title: 'One-step evaluation relation'
journey: fref("journeys/programming-language-theory/index.td")
status: 'learning'
books:
  - fref("journeys/programming-language-theory/books/types-and-programming-languages/chapter-3-untyped-arithmetic-expressions.td")
---

A relation defining a single atomic reduction, mapping a term to its immediate successor by applying exactly one reduction rule. The relation is denoted using the symbol $\to$.
